# {{ProjectName}}

A Struct microservice scaffolded from the `minimal` template: a single-file
middleware chain (panic recovery, access logging), no MVC slice. Good for
throwaway prototypes and CLI-only tools.

## Running it

```bash
go build ./...
go run ./cmd/api
curl localhost:8080/healthz
```

Reach for `struct new <name> --template=standard` once this needs more
than a couple of routes.
